From a3cc941e4d5f84ca272fc36cbba0fd50395965b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:57:19 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Add guarded HVAC fan-level commands

Preserve known driver/passenger targets, circulation and A/C mode under the per-vehicle command lock. Keep fan readback authoritative. Complete existing start projections for values its unchanged wire payload already sets, preventing a following fan command from restoring stale settings.

Local: 333 tests pass on Python 3.12; ruff, black and mypy pass. Related to #64. No vehicle validation; raw levels and AUTO behaviour remain owner gates.
---
 src/pybyd/_capabilities/hvac.py |  46 +++++++-
 tests/test_hvac_fan_level.py    | 197 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 241 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/test_hvac_fan_level.py

diff --git a/src/pybyd/_capabilities/hvac.py b/src/pybyd/_capabilities/hvac.py
index 2e05299..d5c6d01 100644
--- a/src/pybyd/_capabilities/hvac.py
